      "node_id": "kg_doc_10",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "The gin pennant (sometimes gin flag or drinking pennant) is a maritime flag. When flown aboard ship, it indicates an open invitation to other ships' officers to come aboard for drinks.",
